    "body": "It makes tests slightly more flaky (50 out 1000 group sync tests fail), but maybe we need it. Until I'm done investigating, this is back.\r\n\r\nContext: https://github.com/JFreegman/toxcore/commit/26ba49038389e4bc7a38c697ed6da7e7818c08a9\r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2952)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n",
