                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-01-06T04:30:50Z",
                    "email": "iphydf@users.noreply.github.com",
                    "name": "iphydf"
                },
                "message": "fix(group_chats): fix sync packets reverting topics\n\nWhen a peer processes a topic packet that matches the current topic lock\nversion, it typically accepts it. However, if this packet is a delayed\nsync packet containing the *previous* topic, it causes the topic to\nrevert.\n\nThis commit adds a check in `handle_gc_topic_validate`. If the incoming\ntopic checksum matches the `topic_prev_checksum` (the checksum of the\ntopic before the current one) and the current topic was set recently\n(within `GC_CONFIRMED_PEER_TIMEOUT`), we reject the update as a probable\nsync error.\n\nAdded `auto_tests/scenarios/scenario_group_topic_revert_test.c` to\nreproduce and verify the fix.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "04b6556230a159a499bc69ffe68e76233d6769e6",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/c-toxcore/git/trees/04b6556230a159a499bc69ffe68e76233d6769e6"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/c-toxcore/git/commits/e206bffa2dd25bffee1689a1605d4a78723f5eea",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 04b6556230a159a499bc69ffe68e76233d6769e6\nparent 0e4715598f37c9a36b1cb84c77923173b2d7821e\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1767672103 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1767673850 +0000\n\nfix(group_chats): fix sync packets reverting topics\n\nWhen a peer processes a topic packet that matches the current topic lock\nversion, it typically accepts it. However, if this packet is a delayed\nsync packet containing the *previous* topic, it causes the topic to\nrevert.\n\nThis commit adds a check in `handle_gc_topic_validate`. If the incoming\ntopic checksum matches the `topic_prev_checksum` (the checksum of the\ntopic before the current one) and the current topic was set recently\n(within `GC_CONFIRMED_PEER_TIMEOUT`), we reject the update as a probable\nsync error.\n\nAdded `auto_tests/scenarios/scenario_group_topic_revert_test.c` to\nreproduce and verify the fix.\n",
